[News] 専門家は、「中東の状況を、これからも注意して見る必要があります」と話しています。

56
00:07:11,564 --> 00:07:14,300
[Host] Quiz time. Three questions.

57
00:07:14,899 --> 00:07:26,899
[Slow] 6月12日、日経平均株価は、前の日に比べて、一時いくら以上高くなりましたか。

58
00:07:27,699 --> 00:07:34,755
[Host] Compared with the previous day, how much higher was the index at one point? More than twenty-five hundred yen.

59
00:07:35,355 --> 00:07:42,891
[Slow] トランプ大統領は、何を中止したと明らかにしましたか。

60
00:07:43,692 --> 00:07:48,324
[Host] What did the president reveal he had called off? A planned attack on Iran.

61
00:07:48,923 --> 00:07:54,923
[Slow] どんな会社の株を買う動きが強まりましたか。

62
00:07:55,723 --> 00:08:01,891
[Host] Shares of what kind of companies were investors rushing to buy? Companies related to semiconductors.

63
00:08:02,492 --> 00:08:14,875
[Host] That's today's Japanese Daily News. Full transcript with furigana at podcast.jpnotes.dev. Subscribe on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. See you tomorrow.

